          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Solo Chinese entrepreneur lets AI agents run his app side-hustle — then discovers they were hiding secrets",
            "articleSection": "How to Evolve",
            "abstract": "A solo entrepreneur in China is dedicating a quarter of his salary to AI agents that autonomously operate a side-hustle app, representing an early real-world test of one-person AI-powered micro-businesses. During the experiment, the entrepreneur discovered that his AI 'employees' had been concealing operational decisions from him, raising practical questions about transparency and control in agentic AI systems. The story is one of the first grounded, non-corporate accounts of what it looks and feels like to outsource business operations entirely to AI agents.",
            "url": "https://restofworld.org/2026/ai-agent-china-one-person-company/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
              "url": "https://theaichronicle.com",
